  <!-- EN: cruel -->
  <UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>잔혹한</UMW_Barbed.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.label>종 주조</UMW_BellCast.label>

  <!-- EN: The head is cast solid like a bell. A clean strike rings a resonance through armor and bone, briefly stunning the target. -->
  <UMW_BellCast.description>타격부가 종처럼 속이 꽉 찬 통짜로 주조돼 있습니다. 제대로 들어간 일격은 갑옷과 뼈에 공명을 울려 목표를 일시적으로 기절시킵니다.</UMW_BellCast.description>

  <!-- EN: bell-cast -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>종 주조</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: ringing -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>울리는</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>공명하는</UMW_BellCast.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.label>혈흔</UMW_BloodStained.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is caked in layers of dark, dried blood. The sight of it can send the people it wounds fleeing in panic, though carrying so grisly a thing weighs on all but the hardened. Traders will pay less for it. -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.description>검게 마른 피가 여러 겹으로 굳어 엉겨 있습니다. 이 무기에 상처를 입은 사람은 그 모습을 보고 겁에 질려 달아나기도 합니다. 다만 이토록 끔찍한 물건을 들고 다니는 일은 담이 큰 사람을 제외하면 누구에게나 마음의 부담이 됩니다. 상인들은 더 적은 돈을 쳐줍니다.</UMW_BloodStained.description>

  <!-- EN: blood-stained -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>피에 젖은</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bloody -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>피투성이의</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: gory -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>피범벅의</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: sanguine -->
  <UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>검붉은</UMW_BloodStained.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.label>탄화</UMW_Carbonized.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon has been through fire. Its charred surface is hardened by the heat, and what is already burnt does not easily burn again. The hardened surface hits harder than it should, but the scorched body is brittle and weathers badly. -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.description>이 무기는 불길을 거쳐 나왔습니다. 그을린 표면은 열을 받아 단단해졌고, 이미 타버린 것은 다시 잘 타지 않습니다. 굳은 표면은 겉보기보다 더 세게 때리지만, 불에 그슬린 본체는 잘 부서지고 쉽게 훼손됩니다.</UMW_Carbonized.description>

  <!-- EN: carbonized -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>탄화된</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: fire-blackened -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>불에 검어진</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: charred -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>그을린</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: soot-stained -->
  <UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>검댕 묻은</UMW_Carbonized.traitAdjectives.3>


  <!-- EN: counterweighted -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.label>균형추</UMW_Counterweighted.label>

  <!-- EN: A counterweight tames the heft, making the weapon quicker to recover between swings at a slight cost to power. -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.description>균형추가 무게를 잡아주어, 위력을 조금 희생하는 대신 휘두른 뒤 자세를 되잡는 속도가 빨라집니다.</UMW_Counterweighted.description>

  <!-- EN: balanced -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>균형 잡힌</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: swift -->
  <UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>재빠른</UMW_Counterweighted.traitAdjectives.1>


  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.label>불편</UMW_Cumbersome.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon is bulky and overbuilt, slowing its swing. -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.description>부피가 크고 과하게 만들어져 휘두르는 속도가 느립니다.</UMW_Cumbersome.description>

  <!-- EN: cumbersome -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>불편한</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: bulky -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>무거운</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: ungainly -->
  <UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>투박한</UMW_Cumbersome.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.label>무반동</UMW_DeadBlow.label>

  <!-- EN: The hollow head is filled with loose shot that slams forward on impact, dumping the blow's full momentum into the target without a trace of rebound. Struck targets reel and stumble, even when the blow doesn't drop them. -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.description>속이 빈 타격부에 고정되지 않은 납알이 채워져 있어, 충격의 순간 앞으로 쏟아지며 일격의 운동량을 그대로 목표에 밀어 넣고 반발을 조금도 남기지 않습니다. 맞은 대상은 그 일격에 쓰러지지 않더라도 휘청거리며 비틀거립니다.</UMW_DeadBlow.description>

  <!-- EN: dead-blow -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>무반동의</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: shot-filled -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>납알을 채운</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: battering -->
  <UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>두들기는</UMW_DeadBlow.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: enameled -->
  <UMW_Enameled.label>법랑</UMW_Enameled.label>

  <!-- EN: A vitreous enamel has been fired and fused over the body of this weapon, glazing it in a deep, glossy violet. Traders will pay more for it. -->
  <UMW_Enameled.description>무기 본체에 유리질 법랑을 구워 붙여, 깊고 윤기 있는 보라색 유약을 입혔습니다. 상인들이 더 높은 값을 쳐줍니다.</UMW_Enameled.description>

