  <!-- EN: ornamental -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.label>장식용</UMW_Ornamental.label>

  <!-- EN: This weapon was crafted for aesthetics over functionality. It deals less damage but looks great. -->
  <UMW_Ornamental.description>실용성보다 심미성을 중시해 제작됐습니다. 피해량은 적지만 멋있게 보입니다.</UMW_Ornamental.description>

